awk '
{
print "No of line:"NR",No of fields:"NF, "$0="$0, "$1="$1, "$2="$2, "$3="$3
}
'

Passing an external variable to awk
-----------------------------------

$VAR=10000
echo | awk -v VARIABLE=$VAR '{ print VARIABLE }'

Reading the external terminal output to a variable
--------------------------------------------------


echo | awk '{ "find . -type f -name 'k*' -print" | getline output ; print output}'

